央广场。街道两侧摆放着几个大水盆，里面装着刚刚从河里打捞上来的鲜鱼，不时溅起水花将买菜妇人的衣摆弄湿。一个邋遢道士手拿桃木剑，疯疯癫癫的立在肉铺前说着些听不懂的胡话。几个不知是何门何派的年轻弟子正好奇的朝着四周看来，似乎是第一次下山。",down="hdroom0525",left="hdroom0518",right="hdroom0520",roomRoles={"bsnpc14","bsnpc32","bsnpc33"},roomItems={"bswp13"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0520={id="hdroom0520",name="平安东街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="中央广场东面的大街，往西便是中央广场。街道两侧摆放着几个大水盆，里面装着刚刚从河里打捞上来的鲜鱼，不时溅起水花将买菜妇人的衣摆弄湿。一个邋遢道士手拿桃木剑，疯疯癫癫的立在肉铺前说着些听不懂的胡话。几个不知是何门何派的年轻弟子正好奇的朝着四周看来，似乎是第一次下山。",up="hdroom0513",down="hdroom0526",left="hdroom0519",right="hdroom0521",roomRoles={"bsnpc34"},roomItems={"bswp14"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0521={id="hdroom0521",name="浮云寺门",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="浮云寺的大门，门上有金字写就的牌匾。不知打哪儿来的算卦道士在附近摆了一个摊位，倒是灿若莲花的说了不少吉利话，门口接引来客的两个小沙弥玩性未脱，一边假装扫地一边又往那处凑去，说说笑笑。",left="hdroom0520",right="hdroom0522",roomRoles={"bsnpc13"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions